### notification-service. Start both services first (see the README), book or cancel something in bookings.http
@notifications = http://localhost:8086

### Every notification, newest first
GET {{notifications}}/notifications

### One customer's notifications (what SkillForge's Bookings page shows)
GET {{notifications}}/notifications?customerEmail=ana@example.com

### RabbitMQ's management UI (queues, dead letters, message rates): http://localhost:15672  — guest / guest
